{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1468,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f4dc985344eb0ac0c0adbf0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ…まだやれるはずだ…\r\nやれなくちゃダメだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1494dd39c5c4bb1930848341b02830fc197d772558fd00e5dbdac1e2ab60970c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e76d06d742d94fda775b1d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "す、すみません！遅れました…！\r\nなんでか、ぼーっとしちゃって…\r\nもうしませんから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf266b51c2025be166de554938cfa467fd0faf03222e1cdcf312ed4adad95466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2065fee2460f56021abb419d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと走りたい、もっと動きたい…\r\nなのに、なんで…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5485a7b0b0765b7e8a37f021a908e47c675a2cae18f0f71052065a4fdda3785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c74f1d21873ffcfe5e7184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これだけ助けてもらっておいて…\r\n何やってるんだ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5904943bf8ad2c80c3ab78f577f9e8454e45c8c5973ee0f6a5bef46f081e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817d70cea603e0220d22faa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…。…えっ？あ、はい！\r\nわかりました、レースですね…っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75341a2b617d112dd185719f8970ac16a4f6488993dda3a1565a52f3b812e29e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a92f0c7b80319c1e8e4c6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい、レースですね…あれっ？\r\n変だな、ごめんなさい。\r\nなんで体、動かないんだろう…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb123025e386cc7fea6cfac988c44685b92e4b12121b68058b20333e5b469c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d6d1c5417dc5a1387e050a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが、トレーナーさんがくれた\r\nこの脚で起こす、奇跡。\r\n…見ててくださいね、絶対！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ceff634e8a3254f1eef483e253515704d1e12c6344fc55842300586620e235b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9313a4c3125e80f55f3a5951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日、すごく調子がいいんです！\r\nもっと速く、もっと、もっと…\r\nどこまでだって、行けそうで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2def9d678ccdc9f9298d2f2f6a7523901c41d77cf3765b6a9dfb99b3eb25d8c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c11c062ce44eecbb865a3530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任せてください。\r\n今日のおれ、\r\nきっと1番速いですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02db1d057d23caf2db4873b5570ec288e496d6ffb3739f55e41e3a23c57df87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16211accdc886b100a77f788",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この体の全部、底の底まで使って…\r\nみんなへの感謝、伝えます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3845824c743e5df5cb306c073a8f0b90d0ccc0977fa8879be9b032254cf86ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16b89eafd138c66019aed2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸を張って走ってきます。\r\nトレーナーさんが\r\n強くしてくれた、おれですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d6283f2663f105f739ea96085e4003191d1fd5e48c32b181ec688d43abe3aee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf1691f53c944f20a371d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが起こした“奇跡”と、\r\nトレーナーさんとした“努力”…\r\n合わさったら、絶対負けません。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1543dbd0f4c77485e5156aa6b0f69412863084ca90a88681a4f4ee95f11a8aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03515d839d24d1e48b95cb3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あなたと研ぎ澄ました\r\nおれのスピード、\r\n見せつけてきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a88968f477de1840c2ebe0e398d82a4f3e634560a9e01d721d24b7403de49244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e18aa050a19aa16ccbcdc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースに出る機会をくれて…\r\n本当に、ありがとうございます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cf47bd0280549eba25c113b0f725b192e1b015b9e35cd395d53ccf17dd0237",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3998fe98f22ef20c46760e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日までに積み重ねた全部、\r\nからっぽになるまで\r\n出し切ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32dc3c927cfdfb5fe1ed4ce90048631c5744db29b2b9bb272db2afb62897fff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8544cdd318eb95d8f44e9655",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんな調子ですけど…できます。\r\nせっかくここまで、\r\n連れてきてもらったんですから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4564105a16631a1e091054c2042c82b5b344ce5104db20da3a94430179e1784b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5e55627e74cf66ffef7283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…そんなに、\r\n調子悪そうに見えます？\r\n勝つ気ありますよ、おれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "217771ebe765b4aa70435ee2a7047fc9cb2fb0ae7f7371cadeb743f679be48e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1222859a1ed900696447c6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このくらいの不調、よくあること…\r\nだから今日も、きっと大丈夫…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4292ddd6bc19987d7fb296cb449c203a9082f769d02a6edf09b8af48ed5db00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b078d0f783c2aa761826a668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走ることは、できる。\r\nなら、きっと…やれるはず…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d6dcd7ee69f80ece0c35442b15b6454cc355ab947c6070de513129e30ffc312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4110282f7ebc77816814e4f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…はい、任せてください。\r\n走れます。大丈夫…ですから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97784f639a0b3d600774c168bdf2a197df763d08f9f0ea45fe5ccf7dd9ee11ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a29df29e15d047499392c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何があるかはわからない…\r\nでも、走るのだけは、\r\nやめるもんか…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26241a68aa9416a3c49de530b17b543dfa39ca43339255cffffd1c2364f20f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7725dfb5725e8691bd96adbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はいっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9891b8ba8e1f1a4f5b12aef4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行けます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd34eed60cc81bd1c599abc2aede887997cf68af42c8e7c31b97e1044f538e4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21e0970896225028cdee5ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f464475ead61cacfa6bea987653976126da00e64ef9dec225ea1233750e29dfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a17ec0465b33f55d38d562e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc85de9baa6672c2c81baee59b07561bae8d6e1b887a3e92e1cd1b692282626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b9f68484941a3366faa63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bca6da8ecb6aaeab02e5a22863fa5110f97d666065235a519e4697647e7f875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c39191109126927a0bd916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あれ…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "700b60b81736f0d5344d9bd2f87a676e54130477b67d1ea6b3418c9a22a49632",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8dda42a5b464d14f572ddb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出発ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec04f6635d9b277f81552785bbb91dde59d60afcca4ac146e2189d7ea2c09308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13dae73d6243c3bd43664d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気持ちいい…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82b9c345c37d09b7bc500a754031d73d9d138dd24200aa93ef354007842aa30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5bbad02a6780714eb3664c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、みんな！\r\nありがとうっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d038b12df2ab780c88e970bbd1ab7aed89f71b80cc5cf375c4e21dec2861946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5868e258aadb8233869bdede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで来られて、よかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f81c08ac7ea85efa87e83309223dee4c8daa07c6ee22aaf10fb562a7c4325c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b32d2b240636bd0f25e142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれで助けになれるなら…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26f7c8fddf927ccba136ff57a0e85727c67cd5348cd724ad711409da80820211",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67fb78bf19b7cfd87c2964e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力で、いきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0edfce041c74dd68a9b45fd554801f6bf60a50343da20a560e7de361e5c1989a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba49ee2bca7d10828eaff8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うん…みんな、行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78df9570d08420c31c154d2d85189a60480667cba1ce695d610d9a843328d7ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747e466612a335cdb6ed45eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで来られて、よかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f81c08ac7ea85efa87e83309223dee4c8daa07c6ee22aaf10fb562a7c4325c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5131f43120a2483e2788abbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが起こした“奇跡”と、\r\nトレーナーさんとした“努力”…\r\n合わさったら、絶対負けません。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1543dbd0f4c77485e5156aa6b0f69412863084ca90a88681a4f4ee95f11a8aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:020b1d0c5d4c4a5d9d718989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任せてください。\r\n今日のおれ、\r\nきっと1番速いですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02db1d057d23caf2db4873b5570ec288e496d6ffb3739f55e41e3a23c57df87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6809221015934fb25b095650",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここまで来られて、よかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f81c08ac7ea85efa87e83309223dee4c8daa07c6ee22aaf10fb562a7c4325c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b04ea826619dca85ec06179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f464475ead61cacfa6bea987653976126da00e64ef9dec225ea1233750e29dfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b31806dd8e04d9a37626c0ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あと1歩、縮めてみせます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8507936343096358209af8bcb3cef1c7b4ee37f4dbcb650c8b310db365f2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad0404da94e75aa12dd531e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだまだ速くならないと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f5e195c0785245623627c1dd31bbe40073a57d36b5b7064acc3aac9743eaf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1a781426757b989b33e8cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "諦めません。次はきっと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a27be61b176f77fa902d7e5735311d8e5338855969e6861b20d1e33aa49c9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0e65173dced543ddb8a0076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと速くなれるはずなのに…\r\nもっと、もっと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd3d853658f698bba5bc1e9221822e9f5d88ae4f64028a30d79d15ed64883b24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c747f2862f56345a1abe27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれの走り、おれの全部…\r\n受け取ってもらえたかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfe25c24ba56df28ce2dfdd10577824884134b94f4c13326abab282c1054cfaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d313832a3fe8413de9cece",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんな、勝ったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe4eade957d88fa88ffa6c2a83b503de7b9d828845a04ef8a2f3cf18607af94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9fec46d4dcf7ce56dcc378d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出し切ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7bf6a193617fbbeb7474d4664a5cb22988e5ad959cde3764ca8f207e987c47a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bd2d0339469b6252a21bb22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただ一瞬の、奇跡のために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7655053130a2d94d7c15dcdde053fb1b0759c619be98b7d1e91a0672ecd3b19c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f290c175ffd711e268a3d407",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの目標が叶って、\r\n素敵な思い出作れるといいな。\r\nお手伝い、頑張ろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e366ce0eda36f6c65972d355803be30472cd6d5ff19a4fc5437890bb4fb5076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b115bddc9bd00922d894f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが笑顔なら嬉しい。みんなが\r\n楽しんでくれたら、それだけで…\r\nおれは本当に、いいんだけど――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00af36c9fc339a5b89e2fca83547641fcbb39b5f5c6c3e92003beb36b0395d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6589f6a526bafee885ed9c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃えろ、光れ、おれの全部――\r\nただ一瞬の、奇跡のために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "812dde67c20b4fa793637ddec66931c5c579fc9de1b9a8062d9234a29a9d5beb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:231923096e1bef0e749ab5b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まさかみんなで一緒に踊るなんて…\r\nふふ、まだこのへん、\r\nふわふわしてる。…楽しかったな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbfef687804b4345b8a973efa2851212872a8551076405ac082c86bc2bd8390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2fa8ce1ce05c9ddc8bae3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感謝の気持ち、伝えてきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5799be483a9b2209919f5e1dddeb35ac016bdd665f85a04be20ebec4668a0f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:608158bfbc6a5357500e7669",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんにも宛てて、歌いますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5567bc878f45f4ecfd0e79b533b7ea6d0ec32643840fa22598fab3f96c2daebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2af8b92685c99192d99eddd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれ、絶対“奇跡”を起こします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fb627d171ef763388e928811ae8831925850670f26fd656a710f8bc67c9edf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3612fb1a0b86f0ceca2e912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あのときのトレーナーさんの\r\n優しさが…今おれを、\r\nここに立たせてくれてるんですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45f1a0330c6593c34ef5467add8cc6dcbe6563cb6edd049cfb92615cd9808508",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594e5da4ae97f142fcbf287f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この制服は、おれがここにいるっていう\r\n奇跡の証なんですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3094e80fe384dfaa650a30b90ce6ef576b9ca76385bee6e48f87473f484dd940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff1c7fd7cf0a6632c18a4b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなにかわいいリボン、\r\n似合うかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2eaee00f1a20f5f565efd5fe2713e01c203f83ef51657866c24b5cfa3044eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1e79b0be98e322a611c08c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの優しさ、努力…\r\n全部の結晶みたいな服なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92db702f23052422ef9e18162e2c4506f97bc0aacd2b065f706d70bd49849f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a70c6253a344379c4c5d591",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このかけがえのない日々を、\r\n一緒に過ごす服、ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59fe9ffc39bbb89c9a528cfc530bd8bd7d217784bcd09940f8440ecccac4961b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:347217cf7a79f80032b24698",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気が引き締まります。\r\n感謝を伝える服なので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e591a7e41de41a6c446a79e43533baf8ca2c259c4ed7d877cf936fe38d4adee6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbfcf671869304f47e31c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ところどころに星がついてて…\r\nおれも、こんなふうに光りたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "030e03d3022d4e2f7a687c0be53e60c51ce42fc213705c2e46185d6ccca63f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dff627ca002d5879af6aa29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着替えてみました…どうでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee08c55a751bb57b189641c930b40ad6456ad561355ac8b10f5db3600849c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687e70b1d567ce879104f6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素敵な服を着せてもらえて、\r\n感謝ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaa0ef2e1f7fdcaf79027d5db6dd374bb165602e44f64540265c293e8617998b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56704371501790f7990a231",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この制服は、おれがここにいるっていう\r\n奇跡の証なんですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3094e80fe384dfaa650a30b90ce6ef576b9ca76385bee6e48f87473f484dd940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e58d5f64c6fa6be3a812dc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こんなにかわいいリボン、\r\n似合うかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2eaee00f1a20f5f565efd5fe2713e01c203f83ef51657866c24b5cfa3044eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a525a9c70095549342f672",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの優しさ、努力…\r\n全部の結晶みたいな服なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92db702f23052422ef9e18162e2c4506f97bc0aacd2b065f706d70bd49849f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3301ca301a0225bfc12b3adc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このかけがえのない日々を、\r\n一緒に過ごす服、ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59fe9ffc39bbb89c9a528cfc530bd8bd7d217784bcd09940f8440ecccac4961b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8ef09b4f2f2571505d8cd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気が引き締まります。\r\n感謝を伝える服なので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e591a7e41de41a6c446a79e43533baf8ca2c259c4ed7d877cf936fe38d4adee6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf14f9ac6aeb64c0d2160f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ところどころに星がついてて…\r\nおれも、こんなふうに光りたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "030e03d3022d4e2f7a687c0be53e60c51ce42fc213705c2e46185d6ccca63f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a281a32c0b60d40e9fa7777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着替えてみました…どうでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3ee08c55a751bb57b189641c930b40ad6456ad561355ac8b10f5db3600849c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9db265416d3ff7436db997e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素敵な服を着せてもらえて、\r\n感謝ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaa0ef2e1f7fdcaf79027d5db6dd374bb165602e44f64540265c293e8617998b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6564f78f393d7319b05863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfa4d40e2eb6acd36a22f8bd9a2d4847cf95720f8bc06aa5a2787eb41adf8e84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42014a080d8ead05e3f2421c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようございます。ふふ…\r\n朝から走ってきちゃいました。\r\n今日はすごく調子がよくて、つい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47d5975553eb04db6a4caa42d2025a007d26db69732d5b5cf93a585c6dcf456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdf920bb1cab51a2ec038d66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入院中に母がよく作ってくれた\r\nフルーツムース、おいしくて栄養\r\n満点で…朝食にもぴったりなんです",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d2a5dd1aabdc19b2b8e54732c8403b0c9ad80ab848b48bb2d9874f8a24e9c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e0a50901c3cfb7ac3e3f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リクエストした絵本がついに図書室\r\nに入ったんですが、もったいなくて\r\n少しずつしか読めないんです…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb1ec3670ba89b3e242ec7581c52c599e7facb01673b58746cfce4bcb110630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1e87896e548fb4831c143f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "友だちと一緒のお昼ご飯って、\r\n1人のときより、\r\nたくさん食べられる気がします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "872d10c201a6a65f508472e22e4cbcabb8a6f735b64fee9eaf088077ea7e776f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf1dc31e9985a8b5ddc2e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう少し自主トレしたかったけど…\r\nゼファーが『無理は精霊風ですよ』\r\nって。…叱られちゃったみたいです",
      "source_fingerprint": "556b2da974197c991e5bd64661bb989aed8d086e9430c5921b8995759cad7af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a05e8d288aef4ba740bbd46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流れ星、探してみませんか？\r\nすぐ消えちゃうけど、だから、\r\nすごく綺麗だと思うんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f888709b3145bd35f08b6d65097eaefd80aed8a52f9bf69b19358a92f885be33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbad68884feee54a5eb7e95c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この季節、花を見ると\r\nおれ、生きてるな、って思います。\r\nふふ、浮かれてるのかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceba030ac19c0e5bad45975aa5bda53a9de2cbbfde133e1cf124ec98d729355b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44446675f6d6ffc677b4686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏って、みんな楽しそうで\r\nなんだか嬉しくなりますね！\r\nイベントごとが多いからかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb65d603e068fecd01a2096228d2d4a2ec45c3b246f381c02ea5b3a035c07f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "90007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
